\pard\keepn \b\fs32\cf1 Magnification
\par \pard \plain\fs24 Before describing how to adjust the magnification, it is important to understand the precise definition used on the SEM.  Each output device (HRRU, video printer, etc.) is calibrated and the magnification relates to the selected output device.  So the magnification for a video printer is larger than that for an HRRU (because the print is larger). 
