\par Calibrating an output device is achieved using the \uldb \b Magnification calibration Dialog\plain\b\fs24 {\v K20CQ2@dlgmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24 
\par You may also calibrate magnification against your own standard using the  \uldb \b Magnification calibration Dialog\plain\b\fs24 {\v K20CQ2@dlgmgr.hlp}
\par \pard 
